{"id":"1e75cf0c92655d78","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-set-transitive-set.md","title":"ZFC Set Transitive Set","display":"df-zfc-set-transitive-set — ZFC Set Transitive Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set-transitive-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set-transitive-set"],"display":"df-zfc-set-transitive-set — ZFC Set Transitive Set","depends_on":["[[58-df-transitive-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set-transitive-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set-transitive-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set-transitive-set — ZFC Set Transitive Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"58-df-transitive-set\">58-df-transitive-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in V\">\\(T\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSetTransitiveSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSetTransitiveSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetTransitiveSet}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetTransitiveSet}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The canonical transitive-set predicate is equivalent to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup T\\subseteq T\">\\(\\bigcup T\\subseteq T\\)</span>, or to every member of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> being a subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-transitive-set","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-transitive-set]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSetTransitiveSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetTransitiveSet}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(T)","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigcup T\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":747,"backlinks":[{"id":"efe7e0230be5eab5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4a7daf0e05186250","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"22f0af31d974b262","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3372","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-set-transitive-set.md|58-df-zfc-set-transitive-set]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["c14ba496c480dcd6"]}